                                "sense_id": "ba484e75-1c84-3e09-ab28-aaa6bebc89bc",
                                "text": "That chafes a bit, his assumption that my horizons need unnarrowing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd7a9dbb-9b18-46c2-95ab-e29b97e99c45",
                                "sense_id": "ba484e75-1c84-3e09-ab28-aaa6bebc89bc",
                                "text": "And if you could see how happy I am you would unnarrow your eyes and be happy for me."
